+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Public review privacy and request validation
+
+- [x] 1.1 Trace the v1 public review response and replace entity/customer serialization with a five-field privacy-safe representation; verify a response-shape test excludes email, addresses, customer id, and last name.
+- [x] 1.2 Enforce whole-number ratings from 1 through 5 and authenticated customer-id ownership before persistence; verify invalid ratings return 400, mismatched ids return 403, and rejected requests create no rows.
+- [x] 1.3 Add duplicate customer/product detection with conflict mapping; verify the second submission returns 409 and leaves stored data unchanged.
+
+## 2. Merchant review lifecycle
+
+- [x] 2.1 Make merchant PUT and DELETE review lookup product-scoped and map missing or cross-product reviews to 404; verify both operations cover missing and unrelated ids.
+- [x] 2.2 Preserve description/rating edits and deletion behavior while invoking aggregate refresh only after successful mutation; verify merchant lifecycle tests cover update and delete success paths.
+
+## 3. Product rating aggregates
+
+- [x] 3.1 Implement shared recalculation of product rating and ratingCount after review create, update, and delete using one-decimal BigDecimal half-up rounding and zero values for an empty set; verify unit tests cover halves, count changes, and last deletion.
+- [x] 3.2 Add/extend v2 product integration coverage to assert rating and ratingCount after each mutation and run the relevant Maven test module successfully.
+
+## Workflow follow-up
+
+- Archive the completed OpenSpec change after implementation and verification.
